  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "mode choice: frontal AoE with stun, or frontal AoE with greater damage",
    "skill1": "mode choice: haste debuff strike on top damage dealer, or knock down adjacent enemy",
    "skill2": "first ally defeat boosts ATK and DEF; specific ally's defeat additionally boosts crit",
    "skill3": "mode-dependent haste or ATK boost in combat",
    "skill4": "each damage instance also reduces target max HP",
    "skill5": "sustained burn applied when target loses HP from non-normal sources"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Natsu]] chooses modes between **stun-heavy frontal AoE** or **greater raw damage**, adapting each cast to the fight state. The first ally defeat **boosts his ATK and DEF**, with extra crit if a bonded ally falls, while every damage tick also **shaves target max HP**. Sustained burns apply when foes lose HP from **non-normal sources**, feeding his combat scaling. He peaks in **long fights with ally casualties** that unlock his spikes. Early burst or **lines that deny mode setup** leave his burn package thin.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Natsu]] adapts between **stun-heavy frontal AoE** and **raw damage modes**, shaving **max HP** on every hit and applying burns when foes lose HP from non-normal sources. The **first ally defeat** spikes his ATK and DEF, with extra crit if his bonded ally falls, so deny easy first blood. Use [[Lily May]] to interrupt his high-damage ultimate before it lands, and avoid standing in the frontal arc. Delete him early with high-damage melee like [[Himmel]] or [[Shakir]] before attrition unlocks his spikes."
}
